    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "confirmation bias?? i get what you mean about focusing on my business, but this felt so much louder than just a coincidence. it’s like the universe was actually responding to my thoughts. \n\nbut i hear you on the math part... it's just hard to shake the feeling that it wasn't random. if you look at the patterns i'm describing, even if you cant give me an exact number, doesn't it seem like there's a connection between the intensity of my focus and these \"signs\" appearing? like, is it possible that when i tune into a goal that hard, i start attracting these specific markers?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
