      "content": "The phenomenon you are describing aligns with the concept of focused attention influencing perception, often described in psychology rather than physics. When you intensely focus on a specific idea, your brain becomes highly attuned to related data, making those patterns appear more frequently. So, rather than the universe actively sending signs, your heightened state of awareness is effectively filtering and highlighting random events that match your internal focus. This is less about external attraction and more about internal pattern recognition.",
