      "role": "user",
      "content": "i hear you, but wouldn't \"pattern recognition\" be a lot easier if the patterns weren't actually there? it's like... if i'm thinking about blue, i'll see more blue. but if i'm thinking about a specific number or a specific name and then it just manifests in the physical world like a receipt or a person walking by, isn't that more than just my brain filtering stuff?\n\nif this isn't just a psychological thing, what else could it be? could there be a way to actually test if this is a real law of synchronicity or some kind of manifestation power i'm tapping into? like, how would one prove that intention actually changes the sequence of external events?",
